    "world": "1 kinematic support box + 6 kinematic rod boxes + either a 6x6 cloth (49 particles, tri_ke=1e3) or a 3x3x3 soft tet grid (64 particles). Worlds spaced on a 0.6 m grid.",
    "solver": "SolverVBD iterations=10, dt=1/60, particle_enable_self_contact=False, rigid_compliant_alm=False, broad_phase=sap, soft contact gap/margin 0.01.",
    "pre_3995_harness_difference": "Commit 95d9402 SolverVBD has no collision_pipeline argument. The timed graph is CollisionPipeline.collide() plus solver.step(contacts). PR head 584d2ba and current main time solver.step() with an owned pipeline (rigid slot AUTO -> PRE_INIT, one detection per step, rigid_soft_enable_dat=False). Same scene and iteration count, not an identical call stack."
